<---------------------------------------------------------CAPSTONE PROJECT--------------------------------------------------------------->

#Title:
Automation Testing Using Playwright

#Website Name: nopCommerce

#Website URL: https://demo.nopcommerce.com/


#Objective:
The objective of this project is to automate the testing of the website using Playwright. Important functionalities will be validated like Authentication, Products, Cart, Checkout workflow and Order Details.


#Services:

1. -> Authentication
2. -> Products
3. -> Cart
4. -> Checkout workflow
5. -> Order Details
6. -> Shipping 
7. -> Api Testing
8. -> Payment


Test Cases: 100-120




